Copyright: 2007-2026 The scikit-learn developers
Comment: Ported from scikit-learn 1.9.1: the SMACOF iteration (metric and
   non-metric) and isotonic regression in src/nmds.c (sklearn/manifold/_mds.py,
   sklearn/isotonic.py, sklearn/_isotonic.pyx); t-SNE in src/tsne.c
   (sklearn/manifold/_t_sne.py, sklearn/manifold/_utils.pyx,
   sklearn/manifold/_barnes_hut_tsne.pyx, sklearn/neighbors/_quad_tree.pyx);
   Isomap in src/isomap.c (sklearn/manifold/_isomap.py,
   sklearn/neighbors/_base.py, sklearn/utils/graph.py); PLS regression
   (PLSRegression) in src/plsda.c (sklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py); and
   linear discriminant analysis (LinearDiscriminantAnalysis, svd solver) in
   src/lda.c (sklearn/discriminant_analysis.py). The
   R files follow the same algorithms. The rest of these files is Copyright
   2026 ecodive authors, under the MIT license above.
